Third-party vendored code on lib_extra_dirs (see platformio.ini).

| Directory   | Version | Role |
|-------------|---------|------|
| expat       | 2.7.3   | EPUB, OPDS, and XML parsers |
| md4c        | 0.5.2   | Markdown (CommonMark) |
| uzlib       | 2.9.8   | InflateReader; font and image decompression |
| cpp-httplib | —       | Header-only; test/host_server only |
| picojpeg    | —       | Unused; firmware JPEG uses JPEGDEC (lib_deps) |

See library.json in each directory for version info and build srcFilter settings.

Prefer build_flags or srcFilter in library.json over editing upstream sources.
lib_deps patches (for example JPEGDEC) live in scripts/, not under third_party.
